<title>ZIMBABWE: Mandela in Zimbabwe for talks on Angola, Zaire.</title>
<headline>Mandela in Zimbabwe for talks on Angola, Zaire.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African President Nelson Mandela arrived in Harare on Thursday for talks with Zimbabwean President Robert Mugabe on the Angolan peace process and the Great Lakes region, official sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;He (Mandela) arrived this morning and will be having talks at State House,&quot; a spokesman told Reuters. He declined to give further details.</p>
</text>
